Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.58,0:00:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing I can do\Nis I'll be able to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.84,0:00:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.60,0:00:37.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.51,0:00:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.62,0:00:44.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.54,0:00:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'll be able to do\Nit. I'll be able to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.96,0:01:19.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.02,0:01:39.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After our last encounter with the Dark\NMasters, Matt decided to leave the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.82,0:01:43.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to him, all of the\Nother kids, including TK,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.72,0:01:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,were becoming stronger people, while he\Nremained the same person he had always been.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.18,0:01:51.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt's problems were\Nmade worse by Cherrymon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.62,0:01:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who convinced him that he would never\Nbecome strong until he defeated Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.56,0:02:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though I knew this was wrong, I\Nassured Matt that whatever his decision was,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.30,0:02:05.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would be on his side,\Nregardless of the consequences.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.52,0:02:14.98,Sign,,0,0,340,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\3c&H000000&}{\fs30\b1}{\fad(300,0)}Clash of the Ultimate Levels! WarGreymon VS MetalGarurumon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.90,0:02:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Ogremon vs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.20,0:02:13.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,MetalGarulmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.68,0:02:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.10,0:02:18.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get so bent out of shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.56,0:02:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last thing we need right\Nnow is a hothead with attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.90,0:02:23.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got more important\Nthings to think about
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.88,0:02:24.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's upset
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.30,0:02:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.21,0:02:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all I know is that this stupid bickering\NIs giving me a gigantic headache Chill out
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.86,0:02:35.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt, have you forgotten that we have\Nbeen chosen To be the Digidestined?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.74,0:02:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And would you mind telling me who exactly\NChose us for this dumb job anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.80,0:02:41.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, uh... Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.36,0:02:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want some answers and you can't seem to
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.04,0:02:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,give them to me You\Nhave a point there But,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.78,0:02:46.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.69,0:02:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't waste your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.61,0:02:49.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe Matt's just being a\Nbig spoiled brat You're
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.74,0:02:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the brat Why don't you go\Nmind your own business?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.74,0:02:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The problem with you is\Npretty easy to figure out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.86,0:02:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're upset because\Nyou want to be the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.28,0:03:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, like I want to be\Nboss of this sorry group.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.88,0:03:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If any of you brainiacs want\Nto take charge, be my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.10,0:03:06.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I say we should just\Ntake care of ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.26,0:03:08.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop fighting, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.72,0:03:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to stick together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.16,0:03:11.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.24,0:03:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt's the one who started it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.54,0:03:14.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got a bug up his nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.80,0:03:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have to listen to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.30,0:03:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bug up the nose?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.30,0:03:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a bad thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.24,0:03:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.84,0:03:21.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.75,0:03:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't push me too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.46,0:03:24.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.02,0:03:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd better be scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.34,0:03:27.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting really mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.50,0:03:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.60,0:03:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get real, dude. Watch it. Stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.90,0:03:38.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agobomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.88,0:03:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's Digibomb?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.28,0:03:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two, one, four, Gigi-mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.32,0:04:04.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four, Draven!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.38,0:04:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, there is no need for us to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.02,0:04:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.28,0:04:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.30,0:04:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, you chicken?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.44,0:04:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna tell Mom that you are fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.86,0:04:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, T.K., but I have\Nto do this! That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.28,0:04:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you stop it right now,\Nit's ridiculous, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.54,0:04:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are just making things\Nworse he's got to be taught
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.40,0:04:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a lesson and fast they\Ntrusted us and believed
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.62,0:05:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in our commitment the\Nproblem with you is pretty
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.28,0:05:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,easy to figure out you're\Nupset because you want
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.70,0:05:12.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to be the boss i'm only\Ndoing this to honor the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.52,0:05:14.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,memory of all the brave\Ndigimon that have helped
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.76,0:05:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,us they trusted us and\Nbelieved in our commitment
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.28,0:05:21.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't let them down!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.10,0:05:24.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if we made a mistake?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.46,0:05:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.24,0:05:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to stop them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.50,0:05:48.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, they're Mega Digimon and\Nthere's nothing any of us can do about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.26,0:05:50.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The best thing is for them to duke it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.02,0:05:54.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just hate fighting and we can't\Nlet our friends destroy themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.88,0:05:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a dog-eat-dog world, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.02,0:05:58.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.22,0:05:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The deal is this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.14,0:06:01.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just sit and watch him\Ntake care of business.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.28,0:06:02.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.19,0:06:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have to like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.20,0:06:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Mama, and get a grip.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.46,0:06:07.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last thing we need is any\Nmore fighting around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.06,0:06:10.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.24,0:06:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all gonna hate each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.20,0:06:17.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terra Force!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.56,0:06:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.62,0:06:24.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know why, I love a good fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.34,0:06:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad, I'm gonna tell Mom\Nthat you are fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.60,0:06:36.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's upset!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.50,0:06:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had it! Mimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.50,0:06:44.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna sit here and stare at the flowers\Nuntil everybody starts getting along!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.46,0:06:46.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, like that's gonna help!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.00,0:06:49.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Metal Claw!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.64,0:06:52.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terra Port!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.90,0:06:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.34,0:06:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.96,0:07:00.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.40,0:07:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name's Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.52,0:07:06.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please tell me who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.32,0:07:07.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want to be friends with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.00,0:07:10.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the Digiworld is she doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.20,0:07:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She appears to be conversing with herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.74,0:07:13.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's losing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.04,0:07:15.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem to be nice enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.48,0:07:23.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.10,0:07:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.38,0:07:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zippy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.94,0:07:37.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.66,0:08:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are we? No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.70,0:08:10.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this world, there is a\Nbalance of darkness and light.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.10,0:08:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The light represents all that's good in\Nthe world, and the darkness is the evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.70,0:08:19.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the darkness becomes larger than\Nthe light, it upsets the balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.56,0:08:22.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, the balance seems\Nto be really out of whack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.34,0:08:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, somebody find a switch\Nand put the lights back on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.34,0:08:27.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.14,0:08:31.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know this sounds incredible,\Nbut can we be home again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.66,0:08:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've seen that Digimon before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.84,0:08:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, of course.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:40.08,0:08:47.04,Sign,ANALYZER,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Parrotmon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:40.08,0:08:47.04,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:08:40.08,0:08:47.04,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Vaccine
Dialogue: 1,0:08:40.08,0:08:47.04,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Giant Bird Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:08:40.08,0:08:47.04,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,310,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:08:40.08,0:08:47.04,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,348,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Sonic Destroyer
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.28,0:08:42.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Parrotmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.40,0:08:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was the mysterious\NDigimon that appeared in
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.52,0:08:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Highton View Terrace\Napproximately four years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.30,0:08:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now he's completely Digivolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.40,0:08:51.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He passed through the dimensional divide.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.54,0:08:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some time ago, a Digi-egg fell through\Na hole from our world to yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.20,0:08:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari, what are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.28,0:09:00.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think Kari's had too much catnip.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.52,0:09:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My theory is that someone else is\Nusing Kari's body to speak for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.62,0:09:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My wish is that there be peace\Nand happiness for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.92,0:09:09.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.83,0:09:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you some kind of\Nsuper being or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.00,0:09:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, nothing like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.64,0:09:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am similar to the Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.54,0:09:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was produced by data bytes\Ntaken from the Internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.34,0:09:19.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's a difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.38,0:09:24.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unlike the Digimon, we're unable to take\Na shake in the form of a physical body.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.78,0:09:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In order for me to communicate to\Nyou, I had to temporarily borrow Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.44,0:09:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Couldn't you have taken Joe instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.58,0:09:34.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why Hikari? She's the only one\Nthat I'm able to communicate with.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.36,0:09:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.56,0:09:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to contact you when\Nyou arrived at File Island,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.48,0:09:41.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it was completely impossible\Nunder the circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.02,0:09:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, it's a blast from the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.20,0:09:49.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's us four years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.88,0:09:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's me. How typical.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.86,0:09:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm on the telephone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.98,0:09:55.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.46,0:09:57.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hard to believe we were that little.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.40,0:09:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's me and my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.54,0:10:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's definitely me, but\Nwhat's with the light?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.48,0:10:05.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its purpose is to process all\Nof your vital information.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.84,0:10:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's kind of freaky.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.14,0:10:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is it doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.24,0:10:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.72,0:10:11.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll explain it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.72,0:10:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.40,0:10:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check this out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.36,0:11:03.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They look like digi-eggs!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.64,0:11:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, Crests and Digivices!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.70,0:11:08.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, this is getting weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.66,0:11:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and floating in the sky is normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.50,0:11:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, it's official.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.72,0:11:18.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is definitely giving me the creeps.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.16,0:11:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, fellas?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.50,0:11:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you say hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.04,0:11:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These men are just computer images.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.12,0:11:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are figments from the past Who have\Nbeen digitally transmitted to your present
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.02,0:11:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it. This is\Nfrom Myotismund's castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.08,0:11:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's Myotismund's
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.20,0:11:40.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,secret
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.11,0:11:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,passage
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.03,0:11:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.94,0:11:47.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.74,0:11:50.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,guess Those are the elves\Nthat make the shoes at
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.76,0:11:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,night They're monitoring the positive and
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.14,0:11:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,negative forces To preserve\Nharmony in the world
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.34,0:12:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We took the information that\Nwe scanned from all of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.34,0:12:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then we created your digivices\Nand crests. You did that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.06,0:12:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That must mean that you're\Nthe ones who chose us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.52,0:12:07.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.92,0:12:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.94,0:12:11.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then tell me this, what\Nmakes us so special?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.32,0:12:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You made it possible for Greymon\Nto survive and digivolve,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.62,0:12:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it couldn't have been accomplished\Nwithout help from you and Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.14,0:12:19.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he digivolved without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.08,0:12:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A Digimon can't digivolve without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.70,0:12:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't work that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.02,0:12:28.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The very fact that you were both there\Nmade him digivolve in order to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.32,0:12:29.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.23,0:12:32.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were just goofy little kids and\Nwe didn't even have a digivice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.52,0:12:37.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A digivice is just a tool that was designed\Nto help in the digivolving process.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.54,0:12:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It assists you by making\Nyou aware of your powers,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.32,0:12:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's the special qualities in\Neach of you that really makes it work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.86,0:12:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The same thing with the crests.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.76,0:12:49.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you tell me what your\Npersonal crests really represent?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.16,0:12:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, mine's courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.68,0:12:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this one means love.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.84,0:12:54.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sincerity?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.75,0:12:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mine's knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.20,0:12:57.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reliability.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.11,0:12:58.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what this crest means.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.14,0:12:58.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.05,0:12:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, mine is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.97,0:13:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wasn't it called friendship?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.70,0:13:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of that's true, but\Nthere's more to it than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.60,0:13:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every one of you has\Nstrengths and weaknesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.10,0:13:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We took each of your strongest qualities\Nthat you possessed four years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.96,0:13:14.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we made a crest for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.50,0:13:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.86,0:13:19.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that trait is lost, then a\NDigimon might become corrupted.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.28,0:13:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.02,0:13:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I tried to make Agumon digivolve by\Nthrowing myself in front of his enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.24,0:13:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then something weird happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.06,0:13:30.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He Digivolved into SkullGreymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.50,0:13:33.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now I realize that was pretty foolish.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.50,0:13:36.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the important thing is,\Nis that you learned from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.72,0:13:38.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All this time we've been\Nracking our brains trying to
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.88,0:13:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,figure out stuff about\Nourselves that we already knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.30,0:13:42.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.21,0:13:43.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a fine howdy-do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.38,0:13:44.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.26,0:13:46.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.82,0:13:48.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.66,0:13:51.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pro-digis!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.72,0:13:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see why you chose Tai and Kari,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.58,0:13:57.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the rest of us never made\Ncontact with the digi-egg, so why us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.14,0:13:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we examined all your data,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.96,0:14:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we came to the conclusion that you had\Nsomething in common with Tai and Kari,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.40,0:14:05.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we're not quite sure what it means.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.18,0:14:08.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we know is that you've proven\Nyourselves to be very capable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.90,0:14:11.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who do these belong to, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.62,0:14:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.48,0:14:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling it's us! Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.48,0:14:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, which one's me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.80,0:14:19.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think the answer's in the crests.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.32,0:14:20.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, this is me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.96,0:14:21.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.44,0:14:24.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, but I'm afraid I have bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.86,0:14:29.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Dark Masters got wind of our plan\Nand have worked very hard to defeat us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.56,0:14:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Save your breath, they're computer images.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.94,0:14:45.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.85,0:14:50.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just because those guys are computer\Nimages we have to sit back and do nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.94,0:14:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His name is Garudamon.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:52.57,0:15:00.04,Sign,ANALYZER,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Guardromon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:52.57,0:15:00.04,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Adult
Dialogue: 1,0:14:52.57,0:15:00.04,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Data
Dialogue: 1,0:14:52.57,0:15:00.04,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Machine Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:14:52.57,0:15:00.04,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,310,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:14:52.57,0:15:00.04,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,348,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Destruction Grenade
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.00,0:14:57.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a machine Digimon, and his\Narmor is constructed of solid iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.38,0:15:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Absolutely nothing can\Npenetrate that can of beans.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.22,0:15:04.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here comes some more of them.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:08.80,0:15:16.81,Sign,ANALYZER,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Mechanorimon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:08.80,0:15:16.81,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Adult
Dialogue: 1,0:15:08.80,0:15:16.81,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Virus
Dialogue: 1,0:15:08.80,0:15:16.81,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Machine Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:15:08.80,0:15:16.81,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,310,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:15:08.80,0:15:16.81,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,348,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Twinkle Beam
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.16,0:15:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is no space-age vacuum cleaner.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.34,0:15:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meet Mecha-Norimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.80,0:15:16.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His twin beam will annihilate anything,\Nwhich makes Husswork a breeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.32,0:15:23.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, Piemon is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.26,0:15:26.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't come any closer! Shoo! Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.80,0:15:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Relax, it's just an image.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.36,0:15:30.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Savior's screaming\Nfor the real thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.44,0:15:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's going to steal the crests! Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.34,0:15:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hide, Mod!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.58,0:15:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hands off those crests! Gennai!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.42,0:15:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That man's Gennai?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.74,0:16:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Follow him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.74,0:16:04.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let Gennai out of your sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.66,0:16:09.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's follow and see what\Nhappened in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.20,0:16:13.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.18,0:16:19.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my Digi-Egg!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.88,0:16:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's why I was brought up all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.68,0:16:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That explains it. Cheer up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.18,0:16:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're together now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.14,0:16:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's File Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.50,0:16:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After Gen-I rescued the Digi-Aids and Crests,\Nmany years passed by, until finally...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.58,0:16:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was born!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.32,0:16:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.62,0:16:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.90,0:17:02.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seemed like I waited forever for Tai!\NFor Matt! For Sarah! For Joe! For Mimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.06,0:17:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We didn't think they would ever come.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.48,0:17:09.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then suddenly, out of the\Nblue, they arrived with a big!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.28,0:17:15.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.19,0:17:16.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.38,0:17:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The question is, what exactly\Nare the Dark Masters planning?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.66,0:17:26.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are working day and night\Ntrying to find out. For now,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.30,0:17:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all we can do is guess and try to outwit\Nthem before something terrible happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.46,0:17:33.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, well, if that's true,\Nwhat should we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.86,0:17:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to say, but I believe\Nyou'll all find an answer on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.92,0:17:47.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.83,0:17:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna be all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.08,0:17:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hi there. What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.66,0:17:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.94,0:17:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We missed you. Did it hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.88,0:17:57.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.38,0:17:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.78,0:18:01.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.46,0:18:03.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.14,0:18:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember what, Tai?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.48,0:18:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never mind, Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.44,0:18:07.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.44,0:18:11.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Matt, there's no doubt about\Nhow we became the Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.50,0:18:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We saw it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.58,0:18:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We sure did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.64,0:18:16.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So now the entire world\Nis depending on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.58,0:18:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we all have to save it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.92,0:18:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about it, Matt?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.06,0:18:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are we still a team?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.92,0:18:22.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.36,0:18:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's put the past behind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.72,0:18:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, but you wouldn't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.24,0:18:29.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.15,0:18:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I say that you and I should\Nlet bygones be bygones.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.04,0:18:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not the problem, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.64,0:18:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This thing is bigger than either of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.46,0:18:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not about right or wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.98,0:18:39.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have my path and you have yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.18,0:18:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm not even sure where\Nthis path is going to lead me,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.84,0:18:45.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I know I have to find it for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.46,0:18:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I still believe in all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.66,0:18:50.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, without any of\Nyou, where would I be?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.54,0:18:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all just so confusing,\Nand I let it get to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.50,0:18:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's why we fought.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.02,0:18:57.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.93,0:18:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's important that you\Nguys can count on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.42,0:19:01.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'm going to do\Nthis because I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.32,0:19:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon Omon will be with\Nme, so I'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.50,0:19:05.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.41,0:19:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be a lot better this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.90,0:19:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt, if you approach this logically,\NI'm sure you'll reconsider your decision,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.96,0:19:11.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your crest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.87,0:19:13.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its theme is to promote...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.30,0:19:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Friendship, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.76,0:19:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I haven't been too much of a\Nfriend, in case you haven't noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.94,0:19:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's because I don't know\Nthe true meaning of the word,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.42,0:19:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or maybe I've just forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.14,0:19:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.32,0:19:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's break up into two\Ngroups instead of one big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.78,0:19:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I really\Nneed to do this alone. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.74,0:19:32.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I believe in you, and I'm\Nnot going to stand in your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.86,0:19:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to\Ndo without you, Matt?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.20,0:19:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a big kid now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.52,0:19:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can take care of yourself, TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.36,0:19:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but... Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.02,0:19:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.38,0:19:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, you know how big brothers are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.22,0:19:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They need their own space.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.50,0:19:45.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.92,0:19:46.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.83,0:19:47.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll see ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.30,0:19:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.56,0:19:56.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We better move it troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.20,0:19:59.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got the world to save\Nso we're down one digi-dusted.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.48,0:20:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.50,0:20:01.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could do it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.10,0:20:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Mimi?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.32,0:20:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Sora.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.44,0:20:07.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.30,0:20:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.98,0:20:10.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.78,0:20:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I just don't want to see\Nanybody else fight or hurt themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.36,0:20:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.30,0:20:19.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I'm staying, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.14,0:20:20.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.05,0:20:23.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not safe for Mimi\Nto be here all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.00,0:20:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure she's okay, and then\Nhopefully later we can rejoin you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.86,0:20:31.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay? Okay. Good luck,\NJoe. Thanks. Wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.58,0:20:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, now we're all\Ngonna be split up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.04,0:20:37.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just when we were finally all together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.22,0:20:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may think we're separated,\Nbut we're really not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.20,0:20:41.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.11,0:20:44.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The roads might be different, but\Nthe place we end up in is the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.56,0:20:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.44,0:20:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they truly are the Digidestined,\Nthey're destined to be together once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.16,0:20:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least, that's the\Nway I hope it works out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.62,0:21:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.12,0:21:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid of my future.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.62,0:21:25.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.53,0:21:31.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A smile. I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.06,0:21:38.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the middle of my heart I'll
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.10,0:21:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be able to be one more time.\NI'll be able to become one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.46,0:21:51.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More. I can't do it now. I'll\Nbe able to get the courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.28,0:21:54.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to get the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.36,0:21:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to see the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.62,0:22:04.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to look at\Nthe sky. Go to the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.54,0:22:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go to the moon. It's\Nstill starting to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.04,0:22:12.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a dream adventure
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.24,0:22:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La la la. La
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.82,0:22:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,la la La la la
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.74,0:22:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La la la
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.85,0:23:04.98,Sign,,0,0,320,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\3c&H000000&}{\fs30\b1}{\fad(300,0)}MetalEtemon's Counterattack
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.74,0:23:04.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.

